OL,3,ABombs preventing rescue of kidnapped
OL,4,Ayouths, Nigerian police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigerian police say they have located a
OL,7,Fcamp where 19 national youth service
OL,8,Frecruits are being held by gunmen but
OL,9,Fcannot move in as they believe the
OL,10,Fplace is mined with explosives.
OL,12,FPolice Commissioner Audu Bosso said
OL,13,Fdrones helped locate the camp where the
OL,14,Fprospective National Youth Service
OL,15,FCorps (NYSC) members were taken after
OL,16,Fbeing abducted last week in the
OL,17,Fsouth-eastern Imo state.
OL,19,FThe exact location of the camp has not
OL,20,Fbeen disclosed and police have not
OL,21,Fidentified those responsible for the
OL,22,Fkidnapping.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
