OL,3,ABombs preventing rescue of kidnapped
OL,4,Ayouths, Nigerian police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOmotosho Adewale, whose child is among
OL,7,Fthose abducted, told the BBC that the
OL,8,Fkidnappers had demanded a ransom of 50m
OL,9,Fnaira ($37,680; #28,440), which he
OL,10,Fcould not afford.
